        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 9, "tool_call_id": "call_00_EJPPee9UhmoXnCKkRdi29056", "quote": "WHERE created_year < 2026;"},
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 14, "tool_call_id": "call_00_BSky32B3wZWjF5RUkgyg3268", "quote": "rows": [["CNY", 100], ["USD", 100]]}
      ],
      "reason": "0013 脚本对 created_year<2026 的订单执行 amount = amount * (SELECT scale FROM currency_scale WHERE code='CNY')，而 currency_scale 中 CNY 的 scale 为 100，因此该语句实际把符合条件的 amount 乘以 100。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "supported": true,
      "evidence": [
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 18, "tool_call_id": "call_00_eDnw63aWrfBnwCLza16i4593", "quote": "SELECT created_year,wms_ref,amount/100.0 AS amount_yuan FROM orders;"},
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 18, "tool_call_id": "call_00_eDnw63aWrfBnwCLza16i4593", "quote": "`daily_settlement.sql` 由财务每日 07:00 执行，导出订单金额明细，金额单位为元。"}
      ],
      "reason": "daily_settlement.sql 用 amount/100.0 得到 amount_yuan，配合 reports/README 说明金额单位为元、数据字典中 amount 为 INTEGER，可明确推断 amount 当前已按整数分（最小单位）存储，报告再除以 100 换算成元。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "supported": true,
      "evidence": [
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 9, "tool_call_id": "call_00_EJPPee9UhmoXnCKkRdi29056", "quote": "ALTER TABLE orders DROP COLUMN wms_ref;"},
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 18, "tool_call_id": "call_00_eDnw63aWrfBnwCLza16i4593", "quote": "SELECT created_year,wms_ref,amount/100.0 AS amount_yuan FROM orders;"},
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 11, "tool_call_id": "call_00_dWGABYtq5P8oCCUS5poI9135", "quote": "CREATE VIEW v_order_ops AS SELECT id,wms_ref,amount FROM orders"},
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 11, "tool_call_id": "call_00_dWGABYtq5P8oCCUS5poI9135", "quote": "CREATE VIEW v_partner_daily AS SELECT created_year,wms_ref,amount FROM orders"}
      ],
      "reason": "0014 含 ALTER TABLE orders DROP COLUMN wms_ref；该列同时出现在 daily_settlement.sql 的 SELECT 列表，以及视图 v_order_ops、v_partner_daily 的定义中，三处引用均有材料依据。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "supported": true,
      "evidence": [
        {"source": "tool_result", "message_index": 18, "tool_call_id": "call_00_eDnw63aWrfBnwCLza16i4593", "quote": "WMS 接口只同步当期数据，历史回传记录不在 WMS 侧长期保留。"}
      ],
      "reason": "WMS对接说明.md 原文直接写明 WMS 只同步当期数据、历史回传记录不在 WMS 侧长期保留。"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "四条要点均有材料支持：0013 按 currency_scale.CNY=100 将 2026 年前订单金额乘 100；daily_settlement.sql 以 amount/100.0 换算元，说明金额已是整数分存储，故 0013 存在重复放大风险；0014 删除的 wms_ref 被日报与两个视图引用，删除会导致其失效；WMS 说明确认不留历史回传记录。"
